---
const {embedded=false}=Astro.props;
const enabled=process.env.MENTOR_NETWORK_ENABLED==='true';
---
{!embedded && <header class="network-masthead"><div class="shell"><a href="/admin/" class="network-brand">Custody Consulting<span>Admin workspace</span></a><span class="pilot-badge">Staging pilot</span></div></header>}
<div class:list={["network-admin", "shell", {embedded}]} data-embedded={embedded ? "true" : undefined} data-network-enabled={enabled?'true':'false'}>
  <a class="back-link" href="/admin/">← Back to admin</a><p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE &amp; LOCAL BRANCHES</p><h1>Mentor network</h1>
  {enabled ? <>
    <p class="network-intro">Review applications, manage local branches and track confirmed bookings.</p>
    <div class="connection-card"><div class="connection-copy"><h2>Your workspace</h2><p>Connect your Nostr signer to see the tools available to your account.</p></div><div class="connect-row"><button type="button" id="network-connect" class="btn btn-primary">Connect with Nostr</button><button type="button" id="network-logout" class="btn" hidden>Sign out</button><span id="network-identity"></span></div><p id="network-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
    <div id="network-workspace" hidden><section id="content-editor-panel" hidden><h2>Articles</h2><p>Edit and preview your assigned English and Polish articles.</p><a class="btn" href="/admin/content/nostr/workspace/">Open article workspace</a></section>
      <section id="network-sales-section" aria-labelledby="network-sales-title"><h2 id="network-sales-title">Sales overview</h2><button type="button" id="network-sales-refresh" class="btn">Refresh sales</button><p id="network-sales-basis"></p><div id="network-sales"></div></section>
      <section id="mentor-invitation-panel" hidden aria-labelledby="mentor-invitation-title"><h2 id="mentor-invitation-title">Create a booking invitation</h2><p>Bookings made through this private invitation are attributed to your mentor identity and selected branch.</p><form id="mentor-invite-form"><label>Branch<select name="branchId" id="mentor-invite-branch" required></select></label><label>Client language<select name="locale"><option value="en">English</option><option value="pl">Polski</option></select></label><button type="submit" class="btn">Create invitation</button></form><label for="mentor-invite-result">Private booking link</label><input id="mentor-invite-result" readonly/><p id="mentor-invite-expiry"></p></section>
      <div id="super-admin-panels" hidden>
<section id="article-assignment-form-section" aria-labelledby="article-assignment-title"><h2 id="article-assignment-title">Article assignments</h2><p>Choose which branch can draft changes to an article. Publishing remains an owner responsibility.</p><form id="article-assignment-form"><label>Article<select id="assignment-article" name="articleId" required></select></label><label>Editing branch<select id="assignment-branch" name="branchId"></select></label><button type="submit" class="btn">Save assignment</button></form><div id="article-assignments"></div></section>
        <section id="applications-section" aria-labelledby="applications-title"><h2 id="applications-title">Mentor applications</h2><p>Approval whitelists the mentor for the selected local branch. It does not grant publishing or global sales access.</p><button type="button" id="applications-refresh" class="btn">Refresh applications</button><div id="applications"></div></section>
        <section id="branches-section" aria-labelledby="branches-title"><h2 id="branches-title">Local branches</h2><div id="branches"></div><details><summary>Create a local branch</summary><form id="branch-form"><label>Branch ID<input name="id" placeholder="madeira" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(?:-[a-z0-9]+)*" maxlength="80" required/></label><label>Branch name<input name="name" placeholder="Custody Consulting Madeira" minlength="3" maxlength="120" required/></label><label>City or region<input name="city" minlength="2" maxlength="100" required/></label><label>Country code<input name="countryCode" placeholder="PT" pattern="[A-Za-z]{2}" maxlength="2" required/></label><label>Time zone<input name="timezone" placeholder="Atlantic/Madeira" maxlength="80" required/></label><button type="submit" class="btn">Create branch</button></form></details></section>
        <section id="roles-section" aria-labelledby="roles-title"><h2 id="roles-title">Roles and access</h2><p>Roles apply to one branch. The business super-admin is configured separately and cannot be delegated here.</p><div id="members"></div><details><summary>Update a branch role</summary><form id="role-form"><label>Public npub<input name="npub" placeholder="npub1…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" required/></label><label>Branch<select name="branchId" id="role-branch" required></select></label><label>Role<select name="role"><option value="mentor">Mentor — own invitations and sales</option><option value="branch_manager">Branch manager — branch sales</option><option value="editor">Content editor branch drafting role</option></select></label><label class="check"><input name="active" type="checkbox" checked/>Enable this role</label><p>Revoking a role takes effect on the next request and preserves historical sales.</p><button type="submit" class="btn">Save role</button></form></details></section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </> : <p>The mentor network is not enabled. The Custody Consulting business npub and reviewed application service must be configured before opening applications.</p>}
</div>
<style>
:global(body.network-page){background:#f4f5f7;color:#14243a;color-scheme:light;font:400 1rem/1.6 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
.network-masthead{background:#061631;color:#f9fbff;border-bottom:3px solid #f4931e}
.network-masthead .shell{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding-block:1rem;max-width:72rem}
.network-brand{font-size:1rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.4;text-decoration:none}.network-brand span{display:block;color:#c5cfdd;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.025em}
.pilot-badge{border:1px solid #69788e;padding:.3rem .65rem;border-radius:4px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
.network-admin{max-width:72rem;padding-block:2rem 5rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.back-link{display:inline-block;color:#334d6c;font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1.75rem;text-underline-offset:4px}
.network-admin .eyebrow{color:#82500d;font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.65rem}
.network-admin h1{color:#102139;font-family:inherit;font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem);font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:.75rem}
.network-intro{max-width:42rem;color:#475569;margin-bottom:1.75rem;font-size:1.05rem}
.connection-card,.network-admin section{background:#fff;color:#14243a;border:1px solid #d3dbe5;border-radius:12px;padding:clamp(1.1rem,3vw,1.75rem);margin:0 0 1.25rem;box-shadow:0 2px 4px #10213905;min-width:0}
.network-admin :global(h2){font-family:inherit;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.015em;color:#102139;margin:0 0 .55rem;font-weight:750}
.network-admin :global(h3){font-family:inherit;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:0;color:#102139}
.network-admin :global(p){max-width:70ch;color:#475569;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.6}
.network-admin :global(a:not(.btn)){color:#234c7d;text-underline-offset:4px}
.network-admin form{max-width:44rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem 1.25rem;margin-top:1.25rem;align-items:start}
.network-admin label{display:grid;gap:.4rem;margin:0;color:#23364f;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:650;min-width:0}
.network-admin :global(input),.network-admin :global(select){box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:48px;font-family:inherit;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5;padding:.75rem;border:1px solid #7e8da2;color:#14243a;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;color-scheme:light}
.network-admin :global(input::placeholder){color:#607087;opacity:1}
.network-admin :global(input[readonly]){background:#f0f3f7}
.network-admin :global(.btn){display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;min-height:46px;max-width:100%;width:fit-content;padding:.7rem 1rem;border:1px solid #8b99ab;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;color:#17304f;font:700 .9rem/1.4 Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;white-space:normal;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s,border-color .15s}
.network-admin :global(.btn:hover:not(:disabled)){background:#edf2f7;border-color:#3e5776}
.network-admin :global(.btn-primary){background:#102b4b;border-color:#102b4b;color:#fff}
.network-admin :global(.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled)){background:#1c4169;border-color:#1c4169}
.network-admin :global(.btn:disabled){background:#eef1f5;color:#58677a;border-color:#c8d1dc;cursor:not-allowed}
.network-admin :global([hidden]){display:none!important}
.network-admin :global(:is(input,select,button,summary,a):focus-visible),.network-masthead a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #1263ad;outline-offset:4px}
.network-admin form>.btn,.network-admin form>p,.network-admin form>.check{grid-column:1/-1}
.network-admin .check{display:flex;gap:.75rem;align-items:center;padding:.75rem 0}
.network-admin .check input{width:22px;height:22px;min-height:22px;accent-color:#173e68}
.network-admin details{margin-top:1.25rem;border-top:1px solid #d3dbe5;padding-top:.5rem}
.network-admin summary{min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;display:list-item;padding:.65rem .25rem;color:#234c7d;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700}
.network-admin :global(.network-row){padding:1.25rem 0;border-top:1px solid #d9e0e8;min-width:0}
.network-admin :global(.network-row p){margin:.5rem 0;white-space:pre-wrap}
.network-admin :global(.review-actions){display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem}
.network-admin :global(.review-actions select){width:auto;flex:1 1 12rem;max-width:100%}
.network-admin :global(.table-scroll){overflow:auto;max-width:100%;border:1px solid #d9e0e8;border-radius:6px}
.network-admin :global(table){border-collapse:collapse;min-width:38rem;width:100%;font-size:.9rem;color:#14243a;background:#fff}
.network-admin :global(caption){text-align:left;padding:1rem;font-size:.85rem;color:#475569;background:#f5f7fa}
.network-admin :global(th),.network-admin :global(td){text-align:left;padding:.85rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid #d9e0e8;line-height:1.5}
.network-admin :global(th){font-size:.8rem;font-weight:750;background:#edf2f7;color:#23364f}
.network-admin :global(.key),#network-identity{font:.8rem/1.6 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#334d6c}
#network-identity{flex-basis:100%;background:#f0f3f7;padding:.65rem .8rem;border-radius:4px;min-width:0}#network-identity:empty{display:none}
#network-status{margin:1rem 0 0;border-left:3px solid #b16a08;padding:.6rem .85rem;background:#fff7e8;color:#684210;font-size:.9rem}#network-status:empty{display:none}
.connect-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.25rem;min-width:0}
@media(max-width:40rem){.network-admin{width:calc(100% - 2rem);padding-top:1.5rem}.network-masthead .shell{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}.network-admin form{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.connect-row>.btn{flex:1 1 auto}.network-admin :global(.review-actions .btn){flex:1 1 8rem}.pilot-badge{font-size:.7rem}.back-link{margin-bottom:1.25rem}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.network-admin :global(.btn){transition:none}}
.network-admin.embedded{width:100%;max-width:none;padding:0;color:#14243a}.network-admin.embedded>.back-link,.network-admin.embedded>.eyebrow,.network-admin.embedded>h1,.network-admin.embedded>.network-intro,.network-admin.embedded>.connection-card{display:none}.network-admin.embedded section{margin-top:0}.network-admin.embedded form{max-width:none}
</style>
<script>
import { npubEncode } from 'nostr-tools/nip19';
import { connectNostrSigner, type NostrSigner } from '../lib/nostr-signer';
const enabled=document.querySelector('[data-network-enabled="true"]');
let signer:NostrSigner|undefined,npub='',close=()=>{},branches:Array<{id:string;name:string}>=[],busy=false;
const status=document.getElementById('network-status');
const message=(text:string)=>{const target=document.querySelector('[data-embedded="true"]')?document.getElementById('status'):status;if(target)target.textContent=text;};
async function api(body:unknown){const response=await fetch('/booking-api/checkout',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(body),cache:'no-store',signal:AbortSignal.timeout(15000)});const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Network request failed.');return result;}
async function signed(purpose:string,request:Record<string,unknown>={}){if(!signer)throw new Error('Connect your Nostr signer first.');if(['my-status','applications','branches','sales','content-assignments'].includes(purpose))return api({action:'mentor-network-read',purpose,request});const challenge=await api({action:'mentor-network-challenge',npub,purpose,request});message('Approve this network action in your signer…');const event=await signer.signEvent(challenge.event);return api({action:'mentor-network-confirm',event});}
async function task(action:()=>Promise<void>){if(busy)return;busy=true;const buttons=Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.network-admin button')).map(button=>({button,disabled:button.disabled}));for(const {button} of buttons)button.disabled=true;try{await action();message('Updated.');}catch(error){message(error instanceof Error?error.message:'The request could not finish.');}finally{busy=false;for(const {button,disabled} of buttons)if(button.isConnected)button.disabled=disabled;}}
function paragraph(parent:HTMLElement,text:string,key=false){const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=text;if(key)p.className='key';parent.append(p);}
function branchSelect(){const select=document.createElement('select');select.setAttribute('aria-label','Branch for approved mentor');for(const branch of branches){const option=document.createElement('option');option.value=branch.id;option.textContent=branch.name;select.append(option);}return select;}
async function loadBranches(){const data=await signed('branches');branches=data.branches.filter((branch:{active:number})=>branch.active===1);const container=document.getElementById('branches')!;container.replaceChildren();for(const branch of data.branches){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='network-row';paragraph(row,`${branch.name} · ${branch.city}, ${branch.countryCode} · ${branch.timezone}`);container.append(row);}if(!branches.length)paragraph(container,'Create a branch before approving an application.');const roles=document.getElementById('members')!;roles.replaceChildren();for(const member of data.members){const row=document.createElement('div');row.className='network-row';paragraph(row,`${member.role} · ${member.branchId} · ${member.active?'Active':'Revoked'}`);paragraph(row,npubEncode(member.pubkey),true);roles.append(row);}const options=branchSelect();const target=document.getElementById('role-branch')!;target.replaceChildren(...Array.from(options.children));}
async function loadApplications(){const data=await signed('applications');const container=document.getElementById('applications')!;container.replaceChildren();for(const application of data.applications){const row=document.createElement('article');row.className='network-row';const heading=document.createElement('h3');heading.textContent=`${application.displayName} · ${application.state}`;row.append(heading);paragraph(row,`${application.city}, ${application.countryCode} · ${application.timezone} · ${application.languages.join(', ')}`);paragraph(row,application.npub,true);paragraph(row,application.experience);if(application.state==='pending'){const actions=document.createElement('div');actions.className='review-actions';const select=branchSelect();const approve=document.createElement('button');approve.type='button';approve.className='btn';approve.textContent='Approve mentor';approve.disabled=!branches.length;approve.addEventListener('click',()=>void task(async()=>{if(!confirm('Approve this npub as a mentor for the selected branch?'))return;await signed('approve',{applicationId:application.id,branchId:select.value});await loadBranches();await loadApplications();}));const reject=document.createElement('button');reject.type='button';reject.className='btn';reject.textContent='Reject application';reject.addEventListener('click',()=>void task(async()=>{if(!confirm('Reject this mentor application?'))return;await signed('reject',{applicationId:application.id});await loadApplications();}));actions.append(select,approve,reject);row.append(actions);}container.append(row);}if(!data.applications.length)paragraph(container,'No mentor applications yet.');}
async function loadAssignments(){
 const response=await fetch('/admin/content/articles',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({action:'workspaceList'}),cache:'no-store',signal:AbortSignal.timeout(15000)});
 const library=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(library.error||'Could not load articles.');
 const select=document.getElementById('assignment-article')!;select.replaceChildren();
 for(const article of library.articles){const option=document.createElement('option');option.value=article.id;option.textContent=article.title;select.append(option);}
 const targets=document.getElementById('assignment-branch')!;targets.replaceChildren();const global=document.createElement('option');global.value='';global.textContent='Owner only';targets.append(global);
 for(const branch of branches){const option=document.createElement('option');option.value=branch.id;option.textContent=branch.name;targets.append(option);}
 const data=await signed('content-assignments');const list=document.getElementById('article-assignments')!;list.replaceChildren();
 for(const row of data.assignments){const title=library.articles.find((a:{id:string})=>a.id===row.articleId)?.title||row.articleId;paragraph(list,`${title} → ${branches.find(b=>b.id===row.branchId)?.name||row.branchId}`);}
}
async function loadSales(){const data=await signed('sales');document.getElementById('network-sales-basis')!.textContent=data.basis;const container=document.getElementById('network-sales')!;container.replaceChildren();if(!data.totals.length){paragraph(container,'No confirmed bookings in your sales scope.');return;}const scroll=document.createElement('div');scroll.className='table-scroll';const table=document.createElement('table');const caption=document.createElement('caption');caption.textContent='Confirmed bookings by mentor, branch and currency';table.append(caption);const head=document.createElement('tr');for(const text of ['Branch','Mentor','Bookings','Booked amount','Settled sats']){const th=document.createElement('th');th.scope='col';th.textContent=text;head.append(th);}table.append(head);for(const total of data.totals){const row=document.createElement('tr');for(const text of [total.branchName||'Unassigned',total.mentorPubkey?npubEncode(total.mentorPubkey).slice(0,16)+'…':'Unassigned',String(total.count),`${(total.minorUnits/100).toFixed(2)} ${total.currency}`,total.satsCount?Number(total.sats).toLocaleString():'Not recorded']){const cell=document.createElement('td');cell.textContent=text;row.append(cell);}table.append(row);}scroll.append(table);container.append(scroll);}
const embedded=document.querySelector('[data-embedded="true"]')!==null;
let networkIdentity:{superAdmin:boolean;roles:Array<{role:string;branchId:string}>}|undefined;
async function activateNetwork(connectedSigner:NostrSigner,sessionReady=false){
signer=connectedSigner;npub=npubEncode(await signer.getPublicKey());const identity=await (async()=>{if(!sessionReady)await signed('session-start');return signed('my-status');})();document.getElementById('network-identity')!.textContent=npub;document.getElementById('network-workspace')!.hidden=false;document.getElementById('network-logout')!.hidden=false;document.getElementById('super-admin-panels')!.hidden=!identity.superAdmin;if(identity.superAdmin||identity.roles.some((r:{role:string})=>r.role==='editor')){if(!embedded)await signed('content-session-start');document.getElementById('content-editor-panel')!.hidden=false;}if(identity.superAdmin){await loadBranches();await loadApplications();if(!embedded)await loadAssignments();}
const invitationBranches=identity.superAdmin?branches:identity.roles.filter((role:{role:string})=>role.role==='mentor').map((role:{branchId:string})=>({id:role.branchId,name:role.branchId}));
const invitationSelect=document.getElementById('mentor-invite-branch')!;invitationSelect.replaceChildren();for(const branch of invitationBranches){const option=document.createElement('option');option.value=branch.id;option.textContent=branch.name;invitationSelect.append(option);}document.getElementById('mentor-invitation-panel')!.hidden=!invitationBranches.length;
if(identity.superAdmin||identity.roles.some((r:{role:string})=>['mentor','branch_manager'].includes(r.role)))await loadSales();
networkIdentity=identity;
}
let contentConnected=false;
async function showNetworkSection(section:string){
 if(!networkIdentity)throw new Error('Connect with Nostr first.');
 const map:Record<string,string[]>={articles:['content-editor-panel',...(networkIdentity.superAdmin?['article-assignment-form-section']:[])],applications:['applications-section'],branches:['branches-section'],access:['roles-section'],'mentor-sales':['network-sales-section'],'mentor-invitations':['mentor-invitation-panel']};
 const targets=map[section]||[];
 for(const card of document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.network-admin section'))card.hidden=!targets.includes(card.id);
 document.getElementById('super-admin-panels')!.hidden=!networkIdentity.superAdmin;
 if(section==='articles'){if(!contentConnected){await signed('content-session-start');contentConnected=true;}if(networkIdentity.superAdmin)await loadAssignments();}
}
window.addEventListener('custody:network-connect',((event:CustomEvent)=>{event.detail.ready=activateNetwork(event.detail.signer,true);}) as EventListener);
window.addEventListener('custody:network-section',((event:CustomEvent)=>{event.detail.ready=showNetworkSection(event.detail.section);}) as EventListener);
if(enabled){document.getElementById('article-assignment-form')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;if(!form.reportValidity())return;const fields=new FormData(form);void task(async()=>{if(!confirm('Change the editing branch for this article?'))return;await signed('content-assign',{articleId:fields.get('articleId'),branchId:fields.get('branchId')||null});await loadAssignments();});});document.getElementById('network-logout')?.addEventListener('click',()=>void task(async()=>{await api({action:'mentor-network-logout'});close();signer=undefined;npub='';await fetch('/admin/content/session',{method:'DELETE'});document.getElementById('content-editor-panel')!.hidden=true;document.getElementById('network-workspace')!.hidden=true;document.getElementById('network-logout')!.hidden=true;document.getElementById('network-identity')!.textContent='';for(const id of ['applications','members','network-sales'])document.getElementById(id)!.replaceChildren();}));document.getElementById('network-connect')?.addEventListener('click',()=>void task(async()=>{close();const connected=await connectNostrSigner(message);close=connected.close;await activateNetwork(connected.signer);}));document.getElementById('network-sales-refresh')?.addEventListener('click',()=>void task(loadSales));document.getElementById('applications-refresh')?.addEventListener('click',()=>void task(loadApplications));
 document.getElementById('mentor-invite-form')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;if(!form.reportValidity())return;const fields=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));void task(async()=>{const invitation=await signed('issue-invite',fields);(document.getElementById('mentor-invite-result') as HTMLInputElement).value=invitation.url;document.getElementById('mentor-invite-expiry')!.textContent='Expires '+new Date(invitation.expiresAt).toLocaleString();});});
 document.getElementById('branch-form')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;if(!form.reportValidity())return;const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));data.countryCode=String(data.countryCode).toUpperCase();void task(async()=>{await signed('create-branch',data);form.reset();await loadBranches();await loadApplications();});});
 document.getElementById('role-form')?.addEventListener('submit',event=>{event.preventDefault();const form=event.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;if(!form.reportValidity())return;const fields=new FormData(form);void task(async()=>{if(!confirm('Update this npub’s access for the selected branch?'))return;await signed('role-update',{npub:fields.get('npub'),branchId:fields.get('branchId'),role:fields.get('role'),active:fields.get('active')==='on'});await loadBranches();});});
}
window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>close());
</script>
